---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const testflightUrl = "https://testflight.apple.com/join/K8FpR5TR";
const forkRepoUrl = "https://github.com/nqh-packages/sill";
const upstreamRepoUrl = "https://github.com/Saffsanity/sill";
const originalSiteUrl = "https://getsill.app";
---
<Layout
  title="Sill Tactile — A different take on Sill for iOS & iPadOS"
  description="A tactile, Liquid Glass reimagining of Noah Saffer's open-source Sill iOS & iPadOS app, with a PencilKit-style 4-edge floating dock and corner orb. Tested only on my own devices."
  canonicalPath="/"
>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/icon.png" alt="Sill Tactile icon" width="30" height="30" />
        <span>Sill Tactile</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Primary">
        <a href="#whats-different">What’s Different</a>
        <a href="#screenshots">Screenshots</a>
        <a href={forkRepoUrl}>GitHub</a>
        <a href={upstreamRepoUrl}>Original Sill</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <img class="hero-icon" src="/icon.png" alt="Sill Tactile Liquid Glass app icon" width="116" height="116" />
      <div>
        <span class="pill-tag"><span class="dot"></span> An alternate iOS &amp; iPadOS take on Sill</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Your Mac’s windows, with PencilKit-style floating chrome.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A tactile, Liquid Glass reimagining of <strong>Sill’s iOS &amp; iPadOS client</strong> — built directly on top of
        <a href={upstreamRepoUrl}>Noah Saffer’s open-source Sill</a>, using the exact same free Mac companion and encrypted peer-to-peer protocol.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href={testflightUrl}>Join TestFlight Beta</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={forkRepoUrl}>View Fork on GitHub</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href={`${originalSiteUrl}/download.html`}>Get Sill for Mac (Original)</a>
      </div>

      <div class="notices">
        <div class="notice notice-credit">
          <div class="notice-label">Credit &amp; Lineage</div>
          <p>
            <strong>All credit for Sill belongs to <a href="https://github.com/Saffsanity">Noah Saffer</a> (<a href={upstreamRepoUrl}>Saffsanity/sill</a>).</strong>
            This project is my own personal take on the iOS &amp; iPadOS interface — exploring a unified floating PencilKit chrome, Liquid Glass icon, and tactile obsidian UI on top of his Mac host and protocol.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="notice notice-warn">
          <div class="notice-label">Device Testing Note</div>
          <p>
            <strong>This build has only been tested on my own devices</strong> (iPhone 17 &amp; iPad Pro 10.5&Prime;).
            Other screen sizes, foldables, or edge cases may have rough spots. For the battle-tested official release, use <a href={originalSiteUrl}>Noah’s official Sill</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="whats-different">
      <h2>What’s different in this take</h2>
      <div class="features">
        <article class="card">
          <h3>PencilKit-Style Floating Chrome</h3>
          <p>One unified tactile capsule that docks to all 4 edges (morphing horizontal &harr; vertical), collapses into a 48&times;48 corner orb the moment you drag, and starts at the bottom so Mac toolbars stay unobstructed.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Full-Bleed Everywhere</h3>
          <p>Retired separate phone vs. iPad chrome modes. Narrow widths adapt into a compact floating pill with a bottom-anchored Control Deck; wide screens pair the full palette with a draggable floating trackpad.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass + SSOT</h3>
          <p>Native Liquid Glass bars, toolbars, sheets, and a layered Icon Composer 2.0 app icon, backed by a single obsidian &amp; anodized-graphite token system in <code>TactileStyle.swift</code>.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>100% Compatible with Sill for Mac</h3>
          <p>No accounts, no servers, no subscriptions. Speaks the exact same encrypted <code>sill/1</code> wire protocol as Noah Saffer’s official Mac companion app.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block" id="screenshots">
      <h2>Screenshots</h2>
      <div class="shots">
        <figure class="shot">
          <img src="/shots/connect.png" alt="Sill Tactile Connect screen on iPad" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><strong>Connect Screen</strong>Machined display bezels with tinted semantic route LEDs (Wired, Wi-Fi, Direct).</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="shot">
          <img src="/shots/switcher.png" alt="Sill Tactile Unified Switcher on iPad" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><strong>Unified Switcher</strong>Searchable Desktop card, live Mac window grid, and installed Mac apps list.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="shot">
          <img src="/shots/phone-pill.png" alt="Sill Tactile compact PencilKit bottom capsule on iPhone" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><strong>iPhone Compact Pill</strong>Full-bleed canvas with a compact draggable Liquid Glass pill and corner orb.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="shot">
          <img src="/shots/phone-controls.png" alt="Sill Tactile Control Center on iPhone with Liquid Glass" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption><strong>Control Center</strong>Quick deck tiles, Aa text scale track, Mac menus drill-in, and streaming controls.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Try it in three steps</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Install Sill for Mac</h3>
          <p>Download Noah Saffer’s free Mac companion app from <a href={`${originalSiteUrl}/download.html`}>getsill.app</a> and grant Screen Recording &amp; Accessibility.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Join the TestFlight Beta</h3>
          <p>Install <a href={testflightUrl}>Sill Tactile on TestFlight</a> (<code>com.uxheavy.sill</code> — installs cleanly alongside the official Sill app).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Pair &amp; Stream</h3>
          <p>Tap your Mac on the same network (or over USB / Tailscale), scan the one-time pairing code, and flick the floating bar to any edge or corner.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <div>
        An open-source UI/UX fork of <a href={upstreamRepoUrl}>Sill</a> by Noah Saffer &middot; Apache-2.0 License &middot; Tested only on Huy’s devices.
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href={testflightUrl}>TestFlight</a>
        <a href={forkRepoUrl}>Fork Source</a>
        <a href={upstreamRepoUrl}>Original Repo</a>
        <a href={originalSiteUrl}>getsill.app</a>
        <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 20;
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(160%);
    background: rgba(13, 13, 14, 0.72);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rim-soft);
  }
  .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 60px; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .brand img { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--ink-2); }
  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }

  .hero { padding: 72px 0 44px; text-align: center; }
  .hero-icon { width: 116px; height: 116px; border-radius: 26px; box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.22), 0 0 0 1px var(--rim); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .pill-tag { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--raised); border: 1px solid var(--rim); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--cyan); }
  h1 { margin: 0 auto 14px; font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 56px); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.06; max-width: 740px; }
  .lede { margin: 0 auto 28px; max-width: 640px; font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 20px); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .cta-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 26px; }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 13px 22px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; transition: transform 0.16s ease, opacity 0.16s ease; }
  .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); text-decoration: none; }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--blue); color: #fff; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25), 0 8px 24px rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.35); }
  .btn-secondary { background: var(--raised); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--rim); }

  .notices { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(290px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin: 18px auto 52px; text-align: left; }
  .notice { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); border-radius: 18px; padding: 18px 20px; }
  .notice-warn { border-color: rgba(255, 159, 10, 0.35); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 159, 10, 0.08), var(--surface) 60%); }
  .notice-credit { border-color: rgba(100, 210, 255, 0.30); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(100, 210, 255, 0.08), var(--surface) 60%); }
  .notice-label { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .notice-credit .notice-label { color: var(--cyan); }
  .notice-warn .notice-label { color: var(--amber); }
  .notice p { margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .notice strong { color: var(--ink); }

  section.block { padding: 36px 0; }
  h2 { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 18px; }
  .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .card { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); border-radius: 18px; padding: 20px; }
  .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
  .card p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }

  .shots { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
  figure.shot { margin: 0; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; }
  figure.shot img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #000; }
  figure.shot figcaption { padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); border-top: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); }
  figure.shot figcaption strong { display: block; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 2px; }

  .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
  .step { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); border-radius: 18px; padding: 18px 20px; }
  .step-num { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--control); color: var(--cyan); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .step h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 15px; }
  .step p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); }

  footer { margin-top: 48px; border-top: 1px solid var(--rim-soft); padding: 28px 0 44px; font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 14px; }
  .footer-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 18px; }
  .footer-links a { color: var(--ink-2); }
</style>
